egad -- license not yet chosen

The author has not yet chosen a license for this repository.  Until a LICENSE
file with actual license text replaces this note, all rights are reserved and the
repository is not offered for redistribution.

What is on the table (the author's stated lean is the first):

  GPL-3.0-or-later   matches GNU Emacs and the Modus themes the colour values come
                     from; forks of AGPL, Apache-2.0, LGPL and MPL-2.0 platforms can
                     carry this code; proprietary products cannot ship it.
  Apache-2.0 / MIT   maximum reach, including into closed products; no copyleft.
  Dual               both of the above, the recipient chooses.

Third-party material already present:
  - Colour values in tokens/egad-tokens.json are reproduced from GNU Emacs's Modus
    themes (GPL-3.0-or-later, Protesilaos Stavrou), as data.
  - Everything else in this repository is original.

Contributions sent to other projects (Nextcloud, Element, GNU Emacs, ...) go under
each project's own license; contributors keep their copyright.
